// Calling a lift: standing in the right-hand passage at the shaft's edge, a fresh W hauls the hand rope and
// the cage comes up from the foot to this stop and stops level (the mole doesn't jump). Step on, and S
// rides it down to the foot. 
// A 2 m shaft 6.75 m deep with side passages: one on the left 1.5 m under the head, one on the right
// halfway down, and one at the foot on the right. The lift built in it is a 1.875 m cage (the shaft's width,
// an odd number of cells) and stops at the top, at each passage's floor and at the shaft's floor (tile rows
// 5.5, 10, 19 and 28.5 from the map's top).
map
##############################
##############################
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##................############
##................############
##................############
##................############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########.................###
##########.................###
##########.................###
##########.........@.......###
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########........############
##########.................###
##########.................###
##########.................###
##########.................###
##############################
##############################
end
give Lift 1
place 2 -4 6 Lift                 // the cursor in the shaft below: the cage starts at the foot
expect 3 liftstop == 3
hold 10-12 up                     // call
expect 13 liftv < 0
expect 14 rise < 0.5              // no jump
expect 150 liftstop == 2          // here, level with the passage floor
expect 150 lifty == 19
hold 160-200 left                 // onto the cage
expect 200 grounded == 1
hold 210-212 down                 // ride down one stop
expect 330 liftstop == 3
expect 330 py > 28
hold 340-380 right                // off into the foot passage
expect 380 px > 18
